ard  it was like and i figured it out within  like  a couple days but it was still really  hard like it took a lot of  me just kind of standing there for a  second figuring out how i'm gonna take  my next steps um  but it had like no resistance to  anything so  like once you once you like kicked it  out it was out and then it came  immediately right back in  and with my new leg  um  it does have resistance and it'll it'll  wait a minute before going back down and  kicking out and stuff like that so it's  like it's a really like my new leg is  very very nice i really like it  so  we actually flew out to florida to go  talk to shark researchers like  professionals  they think based on the teeth marks in  the bone and the environment that was  going on  um they think it was a bull shark  you know they're just creatures man  we're all just creatures just doing our  best  i don't see  you know like they're not evil to me  they're just animals doing animal stuff  my cat bites me all the time and i still  love them i used to make really stupid  jokes and like i never meant it  obviously but like if like something  like really inconvenient happened like  uh like i forgot a pencil to class i'm  like wow i'm gonna kill myself for real  i would say that all the time i don't  say that anymore so i was 17 when i got  bit and i just turned 20.  i just turned 17 also so it's kind of  like we're almost to the three year mark  so my shark aversary is the 2nd of june  and me and my dad and  my sister and kale and my boyfriend will  all go out and have some delicious  dinner together and you know we'll just  hang out it's a good day  so i'm gearing up to graduate  cosmetology school super excited  i think after that at some point i want  to go back to school like a four-year  place or something for biology because i  really liked biology in high school  um and  just kind of hanging out with my cats i  really love them and i have a job and i  got my license thank god finally i like  be